flowchart TB
    UI[Control Plane]
    API[API Boundary]
    K[Kernel]
    AR[Agent Runtime]
    INT[Intelligence: Knowledge / Memory / RAG / LLM / Reasoning]
    CTRL[Control: Decision / Planning / Orchestration]
    EVT[Event Bus + Event Store]
    CAP[Business Capabilities]
    PROV[Provider Adapters]
    DATA[(Durable Data)]
    OBS[Observability]

    UI --> API --> K
    K --> AR
    AR --> INT
    INT --> CTRL
    CTRL --> EVT
    EVT --> CAP
    CAP --> PROV
    K --> DATA
    EVT --> DATA
    AR --> OBS
    CTRL --> OBS
